mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/d77b2e41bd858cac3f9b9532e10104b2.webm?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/d77b2e41bd858cac3f9b9532e10104b2.mp4?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person bullet hell against hive-minded mutant hordes and colossal guardians.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time crafting of ammo and upgrades using resources collected during the mission \u2014 plus pre-run preparation with materials from previous expeditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression between attempts: each run yields tools, recipes, and decisions that shape your next venture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biological contamination: using volatile resources grants power but also draws Everlen closer to the alien consciousness governing the celestial body.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Volgran: a living, reactive moon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/af3c7aa1573495b0984ce7dd0570a5fa.poster.avif?t=1756842898\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/af3c7aa1573495b0984ce7dd0570a5fa.webm?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/af3c7aa1573495b0984ce7dd0570a5fa.mp4?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volgran shifts with every expedition: unpredictable variations, hidden ruins, acid storms, and emergent events force you to adapt your route, pace, and tactics. Survival here means managing vision, mobility, ammo, and supplies \u2014 because the environment is built to punish the careless.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooperation in chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/0317109b1c99fb1c82b4332b8214c854.poster.avif?t=1756842898\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/0317109b1c99fb1c82b4332b8214c854.webm?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/0317109b1c99fb1c82b4332b8214c854.mp4?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for online co-op (up to 4 players): initial planning allows each player to assume a role based on their build, creating synergies that boost survival against the unpredictable. Solo play is possible too \u2014 but expect a grueling challenge that demands constant focus and adaptation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragmented, mysterious narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/ec2db048b58bbac4c71ba62af8cf5810.poster.avif?t=1756842898\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/ec2db048b58bbac4c71ba62af8cf5810.webm?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/extras/ec2db048b58bbac4c71ba62af8cf5810.mp4?t=1756842898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who are you? What does the Drakkar carry? What happened to humanity? Answers emerge through altars, logs, and ruins scattered across Volgran \u2014 fragments that reveal clues to its mysteries while unlocking new technologies and crafting recipes. Discovering them requires survival\u2026 and piecing the puzzle together.</p>","developers":["Goblin Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/b47868a1c87ab81335a83621f1b916e65fe2ce36/header.jpg?t=1756842898","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185975,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185975/movie480.mp4?t=1755689046","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185975/movie_max.mp4?t=1755689046"},"name":"Reveal Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185975/914221e5063cb60c79dd1b9faec3f374de909c87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755689046","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185975/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755689046","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185975/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755689046"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257191967,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191967/movie480.mp4?t=1756814429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191967/movie_max.mp4?t=1756814429"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191967/c787583047c83c68c1c7c45c7d01405f2f9cf181/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756814429","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191967/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756814429","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191967/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756814429"}}],"name":"Everlen: The Volgran Torment","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AM