amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/594f5220904302ca4cf1ef1ff640cabe49efcb13/ss_594f5220904302ca4cf1ef1ff640cabe49efcb13.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756842898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/594f5220904302ca4cf1ef1ff640cabe49efcb13/ss_594f5220904302ca4cf1ef1ff640cabe49efcb13.600x338.jpg?t=1756842898"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/fcd568cbad8283d950c9ecaca72663f3f092da41/ss_fcd568cbad8283d950c9ecaca72663f3f092da41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756842898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/fcd568cbad8283d950c9ecaca72663f3f092da41/ss_fcd568cbad8283d950c9ecaca72663f3f092da41.600x338.jpg?t=1756842898"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/c89ced37b6da29b5f591f2b125e18e58c778b686/ss_c89ced37b6da29b5f591f2b125e18e58c778b686.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756842898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/c89ced37b6da29b5f591f2b125e18e58c778b686/ss_c89ced37b6da29b5f591f2b125e18e58c778b686.600x338.jpg?t=1756842898"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/a4e4abd5a1bce48fc2077e2313f6416076beebe0/ss_a4e4abd5a1bce48fc2077e2313f6416076beebe0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756842898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/a4e4abd5a1bce48fc2077e2313f6416076beebe0/ss_a4e4abd5a1bce48fc2077e2313f6416076beebe0.600x338.jpg?t=1756842898"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/6e44ae2650df37124a0aecf8c65f36b1ad8e7f4c/ss_6e44ae2650df37124a0aecf8c65f36b1ad8e7f4c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756842898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943600/6e44ae2650df37124a0aecf8c65f36b1ad8e7f4c/ss_6e44ae2650df37124a0aecf8c65f36b1ad8e